double_bar_empty_bar_sends_no_payload|start
double_bar_empty_bar_sends_no_payload|stop
double_bar_empty_bar_sends_no_payload|expect_sent_count|0

# Derived values at the edge of the double range (#1530, shared by both collectors).
# A Mean whose sum overflows is +Infinity in both collectors: the canonical text below is the .NET "R"
# text (bare Infinity); on the WIRE both write the quoted named literal "Mean":"Infinity" (managed
# System.Text.Json with AllowNamedFloatingPointLiterals; native DoubleJson) — pinned by
# WireFormatGoldenLockTests and native_wire_bar_json_matches_net_byte_layout.
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|create_collector
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|create_double_bar_sensor|contract/dbar/mean-overflow|3600000|0|2
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|start
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|add_bar_double|0|1.7e308
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|add_bar_double|0|1.7e308
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|stop
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|expect_sent_count|1
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|expect_bar_field|0|count|2
double_bar_mean_overflow_is_infinity|expect_payload_contains|0|"Min":1.7E+308,"Max":1.7E+308,"Mean":Infinity,

# Rounding leaves |value| >= 1e16 unchanged (.NET Math.Round's limit): scaling 1e307 by 10^2 would
# overflow to infinity. A one-digit mantissa keeps the case clear of the 16-17-digit "R" divergence
# between net48 and .NET Core excluded in number_format_contract.
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|create_collector
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|create_double_bar_sensor|contract/dbar/huge|3600000|0|2
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|start
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|add_bar_double|0|1e307
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|stop
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|expect_sent_count|1
double_bar_rounding_leaves_huge_values_unchanged|expect_payload_contains|0|"Min":1E+307,"Max":1E+307,"Mean":1E+307,
